{"ref":"BDB, נֵ֫צַח","hw":"נֵ֫צַח","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫צַח</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.18\">La 3:18</a> <strong>eminence, enduring, everlastingness, perpetuity (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">לנצח</span> Ecclus 40:14 as <strong>4</strong> infr.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫צַח</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.29\">1 S 15:29</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫צַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:11\" href=\"/Amos.1.11\">Am 1:11</a> + 36 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִצְחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.18\">La 3:18</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְצָחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.10\">Is 34:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>eminence:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נצח ישׂראל</span> <em>the Eminence of Israel</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.29\">1 S 15:29</a> (Dr<sup>Sam 98</sup> <em>glory of Israel</em>); attribute of God <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.11\">1 Ch 29:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הוד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תפארת</span> et al.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>enduring of life</em>, and so <em>life</em> itself as enduring: <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבַד נִצְחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.18\">La 3:18</a> <em>my endurance doth vanish</em> (De <em>sap</em> of life, v. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נֵ֫צַח²\" href=\"/BDB,_נֵ֫צַח²\", dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</a>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>endurance in time:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">משׁאות נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:3\" href=\"/Psalms.74.3\">ψ 74:3</a> <em>perpetual desolations;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לנ׳ יְדַבֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.28\">Pr 21:28</a> <em>speaketh continually</em> (?; v. Toy); <span dir=\"rtl\">עד־נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:20\" href=\"/Psalms.49.20\">ψ 49:20</a> <em>unto the end</em> (a long duration), so <a data-ref=\"Job 34:36\" href=\"/Job.34.36\">Jb 34:36</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>everlastingness, ever</em>, usually <span dir=\"rtl\">לָנֶצַח</span> <em>for ever</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.26\">2 S 2:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.20\">Is 13:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.8\">25:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">28:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">33:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.16\">57:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.5\">Je 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.39\">50:39</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:7\" href=\"/Amos.8.7\">Am 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:4\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.4\">Hb 1:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:7\" href=\"/Psalms.9.7\">ψ 9:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:19\" href=\"/Psalms.9.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:11\" href=\"/Psalms.10.11\">10:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:24\" href=\"/Psalms.44.24\">44:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:10\" href=\"/Psalms.49.10\">49:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:7\" href=\"/Psalms.52.7\">52:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:17\" href=\"/Psalms.68.17\">68:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:1\" href=\"/Psalms.74.1\">74:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:10\" href=\"/Psalms.74.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:19\" href=\"/Psalms.74.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:9\" href=\"/Psalms.77.9\">77:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:5\" href=\"/Psalms.79.5\">79:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:47\" href=\"/Psalms.89.47\">89:47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:9\" href=\"/Psalms.103.9\">103:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:20\" href=\"/Job.4.20\">Jb 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:20\" href=\"/Job.14.20\">14:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 20:7\" href=\"/Job.20.7\">20:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 23:7\" href=\"/Job.23.7\">23:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:7\" href=\"/Job.36.7\">36:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:20\" href=\"/L